'''Reign of the Ape Lord''' is the sixth stage in [[Humanity Catified]]. [[Great Ape Luza]] and [[Casaurian Darkjo]] make their first Uncanny Legends appearances here. This [[No Continues]] stage drops a [[Platinum Capsules (Gacha Event)|Platinum Shard]] when cleared for the first time.

